License: OFL-1.1
Comment: Fira Mono Nerd Font Mono, regular and bold, embedded in the binary.
 CORE §2 records them as bundled assets rather than dependencies. `Mono` is the
 single-cell icon cut, so a glyph in a name never widens a table column. Fira
 Mono carries no ligatures at all, which is why a filename holding `->` renders
 as the two characters the archive stores rather than as an arrow.
 .
 The holder above is the one LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt names on its first line, and
 that file is inlined immediately below this header by make-deb.sh. The two said
 different things from P12 — which swapped the face — until P17 found it.

