 On Debian systems the complete text of the GNU General Public License version
 3 is in `/usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3'. Policy 12.5 asks packages to point
 at that file rather than carry a thirty-five-kilobyte copy each, and this one
 does. The same text is in the source tree as `LICENSE', and INDIUM reads it
 out to you in full from its About panel.

